Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:18.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《黑镜》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.77,0:05:23.16,Title,0,0,0,0,,《天使方舟》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:24.21,Note,0,0,0,0,,（威勒理疗诊所）
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.97,0:20:51.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨拉距您1.8英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.39,0:29:08.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨拉距您4.3英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.72,0:31:08.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨拉距您2.4英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.81,0:31:11.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨拉距您2.3英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.31,0:35:33.97,Note,0,0,0,0,,（心率过高）
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.97,0:35:36.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（毒品警报）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.93,0:36:53.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雅绅特家具仓库超市）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.97,0:38:41.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你在哪）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.06,0:38:48.85,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你不理我）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.89,0:39:06.31,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你在哪 你不理我 你什么毛病啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.68,0:39:27.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（待售）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.56,0:40:10.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（和我说话啊）
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.31,0:42:08.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雷克斯大药房）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.04,0:00:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压和血氧饱和度怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are the pressures and saturation?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.20,0:00:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,血压稳定 血氧饱和度100%\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressures are good. Oxygen saturation is 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有什么感觉吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feel anything? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.75,0:00:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.03,0:00:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他这样做呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when he does that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.07,0:00:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.55,0:00:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. All set, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.11,0:00:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,切第一道切口 给我高频电刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Making initial incision. Hand me the Bovie.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,已进入腹膜\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've entered the peritoneum.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.25,0:00:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我竟然没法自己生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.79,0:00:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也推不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't push anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.32,0:01:02.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说傻话了 用不着道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be ridiculous. Don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,膀胱已拨开 切子宫切口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've moved the bladder. Here's the uterine incision.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.53,0:01:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God… - Hey, it's gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.27,0:01:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住我的手吧 我不会告诉别人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't tell anybody if you want to hold my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 准备好了 生命体征如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, we're ready now. How are the vitals?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很稳定 你现在会觉得有点压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still good. You're gonna feel a little pressure now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看见后脑勺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Occiput is visible and…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.31,0:01:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,胎儿出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}baby is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.18,0:01:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,剪脐带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cutting the umbilical cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.30,0:01:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.31,0:01:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事吧 - 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say she's OK. - It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.73,0:01:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Oh, God…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.47,0:01:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没事吧 - 放松 等一等 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is she OK? - Just relax. Hold on. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.49,0:01:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.69,0:01:54.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很健康\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.15,0:01:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她好漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.77,0:02:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,数三下 你张大嘴吃下去 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three and open your mouth and eat this down, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二 三 吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, boo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.95,0:02:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 嘴张得大大的 叉子才进得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Big "Ah" and in it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要这样吗 士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's how it's gonna be, huh, soldier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.97,0:02:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,换我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to take over?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.81,0:02:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈现在应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your mother should know by now that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公我可不会轻言放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}your grandfather's not a quitter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.46,0:02:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一二三\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two, three, and…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想带萨拉去公园 你去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to take Sara to the park. You want to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.61,0:02:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不介意的话我就不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna pass if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想继续画画 把它画完\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to get at that painting, get it finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.57,0:02:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那匹马吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The horse? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 玩得开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep. Have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:02:59.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.68,0:03:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.23,0:03:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,到喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.33,0:03:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.74,0:03:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就觉得是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫米奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mikey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 小家伙 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, little guy. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.84,0:03:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.27,0:03:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他多大了 - 七个月\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old is he? - He's seven months.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.77,0:03:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恭喜 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Congratulations. - Yeah. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,猫咪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我好累 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm so tired. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:04:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望有朝一日他能一觉到天亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hopefully he'll sleep through the night one of these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.55,0:04:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你已经熬过那个阶段了 萨拉多大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you're past that. How old's Sara now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.14,0:04:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,三岁了 她…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara is three and she's…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.42,0:04:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.43,0:04:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来跟小弟弟打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come say hi to this little boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨拉 - 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sara! - Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.26,0:04:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨拉 - 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sara! - Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 妈妈在找你 - 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mommy's looking for you! - Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别急 我们会找到她的 - 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's OK. We're gonna find her. - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.28,0:04:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 女士 - 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lady! - Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在小路那边 滚下山坡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was down by the track. Fallen down the slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她刚才在追猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said she… she followed a cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她去追猫了 - 真对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She followed a cat. - I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.60,0:05:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,真对不起 对不起 妈妈在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry. I'm right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.16,0:05:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨姆布瑞尔女士 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Miss Sambrell? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.19,0:05:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉 对吗 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Sara, right? Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.19,0:05:28.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人推荐你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a recommendation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.19,0:05:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以萨拉会参加我们的实验阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}so Sara will be part of our trial period.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 经过检测了吧 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, it's been tested though, right? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不会做小白鼠吧 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I mean, she's not, like, a guinea pig. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.75,0:05:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经全面检测过了 百分百安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all fully tested, perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.23,0:05:38.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过全面推广前 我们想精确调整\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just us fine-tuning our subscription model.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,订购模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}before the full launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这些孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想得到反馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're getting feedback on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实生活中哪种功能顾客用得最频繁\N{\fnArial\fs30}which features our customers use most in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想上去吗 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna go up? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.21,0:05:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前得到的反馈非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Response so far is just incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.45,0:05:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sense of security, peace of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.06,0:05:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到的使用经历非常让人振奋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the stories we've been hearing, they're inspirational.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.91,0:05:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看见屏幕吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you see the screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.07,0:06:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那好吧 - 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, then. - There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.08,0:06:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喜欢动画片吗 - 喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You like cartoons? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.50,0:06:04.56,Title,0,0,0,0,,喜欢《愿望精灵小姐妹》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Shimmer and Shine?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.73,0:06:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你看吧 我马上回来 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you watch that and I won't be a moment. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.49,0:06:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这就完成了 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's it? - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.47,0:06:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你设置好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you all set up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.43,0:06:49.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我从头到尾教你一遍 好吗 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll run you through everything. OK? - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题随时问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feel free to ask any questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的父母控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your parental hub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.15,0:06:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它和萨拉的植入物配对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just pairing it with Sara's implant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.55,0:07:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 设置好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. We're all set.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.11,0:07:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是萨拉当前的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is Sara's current location,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 就是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is here, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.23,0:07:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.97,0:07:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她走丢了 你只需按这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if she ever goes missing, all you have to do is tap here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.60,0:07:16.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,输入密码 它就会自动通知执法部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}enter your PIN, and law enforcement is automatically notified.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.53,0:07:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是她的生命体征\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are her vitals.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.15,0:07:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,心跳很健康 她稍微有点缺铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Healthy heartbeat. Oh, I see her iron levels are a little low.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.61,0:07:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,她饭吃得怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.84,0:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她挑食得很 不爱吃绿色蔬菜 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, she's picky. Um, she hates greens, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.59,0:07:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给她吃点营养补充剂吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to think about nutritional supplements.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.47,0:07:38.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,按这个图标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, tap this icon here…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,转播她的视觉信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}to relay her optic feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.53,0:07:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是她现在看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what she's seeing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.97,0:07:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太厉害了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.33,0:07:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 真好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy! It's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.01,0:07:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有家长控制功能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there are parental controls you can apply to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.90,0:07:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 控制 - 限制内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, controls? - Content limitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.40,0:08:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是她看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she witnesses something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她皮质醇水平上升的东西 比如压力\N{\fnArial\fs30}that causes her cortisol levels to rise, like stress,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:07.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能覆盖住触发不利情绪的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can kind of paint out whatever's triggering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.59,0:08:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我演示给你看 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me show you. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.32,0:08:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.45,0:08:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这情景使得她皮质醇飙升 这是\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, the imagery causes a cortisol spike, and this…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.57,0:08:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filter on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她现在的所见所闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is what she sees and hears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.25,0:08:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not sure that we'll…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是可选操作\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all optional.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.09,0:08:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要钱 免费试用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. It's a free trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.99,0:08:40.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,免费的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, free.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.06,0:08:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.14,0:08:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且绝对安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's completely safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.38,0:08:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure it is, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经两千岁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am 2, 000 years old…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.40,0:08:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得以前 我们会敞开大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I remember when we used to open up the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.82,0:08:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子爱怎样就怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just let the kids be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.79,0:08:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得因为你不装安全门栏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember breaking my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:09:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摔断了胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}because you wouldn't get a baby gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的胳膊现在如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how is the arm now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在吗 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you there? Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.88,0:09:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.04,0:09:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.13,0:09:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 宝贝 - 我在找妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's up, sweetheart? - I'm looking for Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.49,0:09:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在找妈妈 我不知道她在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking for Mommy? I got no idea where she's at.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.82,0:09:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上 去吧 去楼上找找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs. Go on. Go look upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.28,0:09:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈 我听见你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mommy, I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.30,0:10:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.03,0:10:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见你了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filter on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会好好的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys gonna be all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.56,0:11:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都把你安全养大了 你这不好好的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raised you all right. You turned out OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.90,0:11:07.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是花了点时间 但你顺利长大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took you a while, but you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.59,0:11:11.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了宝贝 待会见\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, sweetheart. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好吓吓你外公 他应付得来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorize your grandpa. He can handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.10,0:11:18.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.29,0:11:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,橙色吸管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orange straw.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.21,0:11:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 使劲推我的手 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, just push on my hand. OK. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.33,0:11:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来 你就这么大劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again. Is that all you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.50,0:11:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the range is getting better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还要多久才能继续骑摩托车\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how long till I can get back on the bike again, you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两周吧 但别骑太快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say two weeks and maybe don't drive so fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.91,0:11:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 那么下周同一时间见\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So, same time next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.84,0:11:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 得周四见 我周一有其他事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually it's got to be Thursday. I got plans Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something exciting?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.38,0:11:52.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,女友的父母要来 所以并不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Girlfriend's folks are in town, so nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.46,0:11:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就周四吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, uh, Thursday it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.83,0:12:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的画 你画得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm liking yours. That's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.05,0:12:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,用色可真大胆 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not shy about using color, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才像个真正的艺术家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way a real artist…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.63,0:12:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要试试这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try this…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:14.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 宝贝 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, honey. Just, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.90,0:12:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公要坐一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa's gotta sit…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.20,0:12:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.87,0:12:32.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:00.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.40,0:13:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.33,0:13:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,护士没把这个拔掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nurse left your thing on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能忘了取下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, she probably forgot to take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.25,0:13:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我摘吧 - 我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll get it. - I can get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.14,0:13:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 别烦我了 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - Quit bugging me. Jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.01,0:13:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,屋里好热\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's warm in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.75,0:13:30.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这用不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.31,0:13:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉 只许吃一块曲奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara! One cookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.05,0:13:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,对牙齿不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad for your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.58,0:13:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发涂什么颜色\N{\fnArial\fs30}What color for the hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.55,0:14:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.16,0:14:59.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,想涂什么都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会选深褐色\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'd say brunette.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.40,0:15:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他举双手投降 他放弃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got his arms in the air. He's given up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.16,0:15:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抽出一根棍子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a stick out and…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.51,0:15:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一下下痛打他 - 关掉 崔克 好恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He just, like, pounds on him. - Turn it off, Trick. It's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.75,0:15:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下可好 行走的告密机器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. The walking snitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.96,0:15:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她没告过密 - 她只是奇怪而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She never snitches. - She's just weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道你们在看什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what you're watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.39,0:15:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,关你什么事 芯片脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you care, chip-head?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,视频有脏标 你看不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's parental advisory. You're locked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.51,0:15:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.33,0:15:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别看了 我看了都后悔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're better off not seeing it. Wish I never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.16,0:15:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我告诉你它讲的是什么呢 这样行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I tell you what's in it? That work?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.52,0:16:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打倒了他 砰一下 血溅得到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he brings it down, like, wham! There's all this blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.62,0:16:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You seen much blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,像果汁一样 粘稠的红色果汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like juice. Thick, red juice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.88,0:16:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个倒在地上的人说「不要」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then the guy on the ground is all, like, "Hell, no!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.37,0:16:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他继续…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he keeps…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.75,0:17:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过了 把我的脸印在传单上我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too much. I'm fine to have my face on the flier,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.55,0:17:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,但海报感觉像是在说「看我」\N{\fnArial\fs30}but on the poster, it's like, "Look at me."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.34,0:17:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉 你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这幅图讲的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening in this picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们快乐还是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they happy or…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.55,0:17:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.90,0:17:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.39,0:17:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道说的什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.31,0:17:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 下一幅\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.87,0:18:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这幅呢 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How about that one? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.28,0:18:02.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,她快乐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.15,0:18:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的病…就像是自闭症\N{\fnArial\fs30}So is this, like, an autism thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.51,0:18:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,自闭症多种多样 但我觉得她不是自闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spectrum is wide, but in my opinion, she's not on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,但铅笔呢 她自残\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what about the pencils, like, self-harm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.40,0:18:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有她画的这些画\N{\fnArial\fs30}And these pictures are…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.60,0:18:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉之前有没有表现出不适当的愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Sara ever shown any undue anger before now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.49,0:18:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.78,0:18:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么可以算是实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then consider this part experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.50,0:18:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,和发脾气 是做给你看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}part acting out, for your benefit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.25,0:18:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,方舟天使没能在全国范围内推广\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Arkangel never launched nationwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.49,0:18:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在欧洲遭禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was banned in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.59,0:18:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,到秋天 在这里也会被叫停\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be pulled here, too, by the fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我害了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did this to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法移除植入物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't remove the implant,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.04,0:18:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但可以丢掉父母监视器\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can get rid of the parental unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.63,0:18:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}The screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.08,0:18:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔掉它 问题就解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just throw it away. Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.50,0:18:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filter off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:18:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.59,0:19:08.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就靠你自己了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be on your own today. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有方舟天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}No Arkangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不打开系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}The system isn't gonna be on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 眼前不会模糊不清\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? So, no fuzzy pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.32,0:19:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看不到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you won't see me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.47,0:19:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.20,0:19:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别害怕 我就在街这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, you do not have to be afraid. I'm right down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.28,0:19:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要是出事了 你也不知道 - 不会出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won't know if something happens? - Nothing is gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.77,0:19:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's important that we do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.96,0:19:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.92,0:19:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要乖乖的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.59,0:20:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.55,0:20:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.70,0:20:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,快快快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:06.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK! OK, this is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再碰我东西 崔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch my stuff again, Trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 我想怎样就怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? I'll do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.95,0:21:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.03,0:21:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.65,0:21:42.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我爸看见 会让我添道伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's gonna see this and then bust it all over again,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.25,0:21:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我惹麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I got in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.88,0:21:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前没见过人嘴唇被打破吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ever seen a bust lip before?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.87,0:21:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在见到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not till now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.86,0:21:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,她关掉了系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}She turned the system off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.64,0:22:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.73,0:22:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是黄片 这是人在干\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is porn. Like, people doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.49,0:22:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样没法造人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't make babies that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,想造人得换个方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have to do it different for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿了一把锯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this one's got a hacksaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要锯掉自己的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's gotta cut his own foot off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这名恐怖分子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the terrorist guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.23,0:22:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好 盯着那把刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, OK, keep an eye on the knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.56,0:22:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.73,0:22:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要把他整个脑袋切下来啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna take his whole head off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.91,0:22:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,要乖乖的 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be good, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.53,0:23:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖 小皮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good boy, Petey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.04,0:23:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好玩吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hang on in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你加东西了 - 是种新的益生素吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You added something. - Oh, it's like a new kind of probiotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.43,0:23:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 能让你大便紧实 - 真恶心 老妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It keeps your stools firm. - Oh, Jesus, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.03,0:23:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你逗我呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.51,0:23:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次出门是多久之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you went anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.39,0:23:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不算跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.94,0:23:49.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said he was English.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.09,0:23:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才不是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not English.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.66,0:23:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说他说话一股外国调调\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said he said "cup of tea, " or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.98,0:23:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这又说明不了什么 苏珊是个傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean anything. Susan's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.21,0:23:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是崔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.16,0:23:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 他买车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck, he's got wheels!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,崔克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, Trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥几个好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.76,0:24:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 神发型 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Interesting hair. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.15,0:24:07.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我逗你呢 挺好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fucking with you. It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.05,0:24:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还好吗 - 不知道你还在乎我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How are you doing? - Didn't know you cared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.67,0:24:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没准我不在乎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.42,0:24:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开车送货吗 - 差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You a delivery guy now? - Kinda.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.11,0:24:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 算是吧 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of sorts. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.06,0:24:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺有趣嘛 我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So intriguing. I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.97,0:24:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说 过一会儿我们要去道斯顿湖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, we're headed to Lake Dalston later.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.96,0:24:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们俩想一起去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you girls want to hang.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.23,0:24:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.72,0:24:31.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定很好玩 - 一起去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It'll be fun. - Why don't you just come?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.67,0:24:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,来嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.32,0:24:37.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸才不会让我上崔克的车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like my dad's gonna let me set foot in Trick's van.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 我们就跟家长说今晚去莱丽家看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, we tell our folks we're at Reilly's for movie night.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.48,0:24:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 肯定能成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.76,0:24:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,值得一试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth a shot, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.19,0:24:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, anyhow…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.42,0:24:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你和崔克是不是那啥呀 - 什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and, uh, Trick, huh? - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.99,0:24:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不会做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.69,0:24:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 好吧 - 去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, OK. Sure. - Oh, fuck you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.47,0:25:05.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不待久 我要和梅丽尔去莱丽家看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for long. I was gonna go to Reilly's with Meryl. Movie night.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.17,0:25:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,电影之夜不是周三吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I thought movie night was on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.99,0:25:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,她妈妈周三晚上有客人 就改到今晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her mom's got guests over then, so we're doing tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.46,0:25:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,打算看些老电影 早餐飞车党什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna watch some vintage thing. The Breakfast Gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.63,0:25:19.33,Title,0,0,0,0,,是《早餐俱乐部》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Breakfast Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.60,0:25:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.78,0:25:23.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约11：30回家吧 她妈会送我回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, be home, like, 11:30. Her mom will drop me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.94,0:25:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好我也要出门 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I might be heading out, too. So…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的 - 是啊 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.57,0:25:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谁晚回家谁就是坏蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Last one home's a rotten egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.24,0:25:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.94,0:25:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊 怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there. How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.42,0:26:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你挺辣的 回见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look hot. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.26,0:26:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很辣吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.61,0:26:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说我胖 我忍了 但我还记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}She called me fat. I got over it. I still remember it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.52,0:26:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想来点吗 - 行啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like some? - Yeah, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.23,0:26:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是什么 - 我听见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What was that? - I heard it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.49,0:26:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.42,0:26:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.66,0:26:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.00,0:27:04.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不早了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.30,0:27:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.72,0:27:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周再见啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same time next week?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.23,0:27:22.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨拉 请留言 说点好听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, it's Sara. Leave a message. Make it good.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.08,0:27:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是妈妈 给我回电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's Mom. All right, call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.86,0:27:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK? All right, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.61,0:27:35.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾娃 我就是想问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ava. I was just wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.53,0:27:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子们电影看完了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}if the girls were done with the movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}What movie?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.05,0:27:40.51,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 《早餐俱乐部》 - 她们今晚没来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Breakfast Club? - They never ended up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.54,0:27:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有吗 - 没 要不你问问莱丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They didn't? - No. Do you want to speak to Reilly?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.14,0:27:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道 我大概是记错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. I must have got my wires crossed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.64,0:27:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢了 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK, thanks. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.73,0:27:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 我是玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Hi, it's Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.56,0:27:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想问问萨拉和梅丽尔在一起吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wondering if Sara and Meryl were together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.91,0:27:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她们今天要去莱丽家\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they were headed down to Reilly's.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.87,0:27:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有啊 我没看见她们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I haven't seen them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是萨拉的母亲玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, it's Marie, Sara's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.54,0:28:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就是想问问 - 什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, I was just… - What's up?
