Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.52,0:40:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没觉得是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't seem like a mistake from where I was laying.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.82,0:40:30.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.75,0:40:34.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.06,0:40:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.60,0:40:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.14,0:40:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.10,0:42:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.87,0:42:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他为什么这么难过呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so why is he so down?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.24,0:42:51.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄狄浦斯说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oedipus says things like:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.70,0:42:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「发生便发生吧 我定要弄清楚」 再比如\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Let the storm burst, my fixed resolve still holds." Or:
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.80,0:43:02.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我决不会被证明是另一个人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nothing can make me other than what I am."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.74,0:43:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然认为自己负有道德责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still holds himself morally responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他并不把自身的苦难怪罪在命运上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't blame fate for what's happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.56,0:43:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而道德责任感是自由意志的彰显\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moral responsibility implies the existence of free will,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.47,0:43:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但归根结底\N{\fnArial\fs30}but actually…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.73,0:43:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉好些了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feeling any better?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.05,0:43:29.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, listen…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.70,0:43:32.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了一些测试 以防是诺如病毒爆发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to run some tests, in case we had a noro outbreak here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.47,0:43:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你吐是因为避孕药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it was the EC pill that made you sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.83,0:43:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 避孕药 - 紧急事后避孕药\N{\fnArial\fs30}- EC? - Emergency contraception.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.03,0:43:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了中止你的妊娠\N{\fnArial\fs30}For terminating your pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.16,0:43:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…没怀孕啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no… There's no pregnancy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.22,0:43:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I'm… I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.52,0:43:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不可能 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't… I haven't…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.47,0:43:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.73,0:44:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,药片会管用的 就是会有呕吐症状\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it will work, in spite of the vomiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.79,0:44:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这你不用担心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.99,0:44:06.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not pregnant anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.59,0:44:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得记到你的档案里 但我可以不标出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta put it in your file, but I don't have to flag it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.45,0:44:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你知道 我会照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I want you to know I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.19,0:45:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.56,0:46:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.75,0:46:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.50,0:47:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你监视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You watched me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.42,0:47:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I… honey…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.47,0:47:04.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 - 你看我和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey… - You watched me with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.90,0:47:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是有意的 - 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I… No, I didn't mean to. - Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.75,0:47:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.87,0:47:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想保护你 我想让你安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was trying to protect you. I was trying to keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.98,0:47:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you turn it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.68,0:47:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过滤开 - 我做的一切都是为了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Filter on. - Everything I've done, I've done for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.25,0:47:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亲爱的 我爱你 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Honey, I love you… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,莎拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.41,0:47:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.43,0:47:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara! Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.88,0:47:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.51,0:47:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,过滤关 关 关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filter off, off, off…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Off…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.36,0:48:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.66,0:49:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.68,0:49:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.76,0:49:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我爱你 - 萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love you. - Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.74,0:49:13.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.03,0:49:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No… No…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.10,0:49:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.91,0:49:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.93,0:49:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sara!
